    <string name="pref_blacklist">Blacklisted tags</string>
    <string name="blacklist_help">Images with any of these tags are skipped. Separate tags with spaces (e.g. glasses red_hair). Works for Catgirl, Waifu and Danbooru; Kitsune (nekos.best) doesn\'t report tags.</string>
    <string name="blacklist_placeholder">e.g. glasses red_hair</string>
    <string name="tag_conflict_title">Tag conflict</string>
    <string name="tag_conflict_body">These tags are both in the Danbooru search and on the blacklist: %1$s.\n\nNo Danbooru images can be found until you remove them from one of the two.</string>
    <string name="danbooru_forbidden_body">Due to a limitation of Danbooru, certain tags have been automatically removed from your settings. For more information, see Danbooru\'s \"censored tags\" help page.</string>
